11/womens-soccer-seniors-lead-west-virginia-to-win-over-utah-on-senior-day</guid><category>Women's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Olivia Shertzer dribbles the ball during a game at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/11/DSC09782.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Using eight points scored by five different seniors, the No. 16-ranked West Virginia University women's soccer team earned a 2-1 win over Utah at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium in Morgantown on Sunday afternoon.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/DSC09782.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/DSC09782.jpg"><media:title>Olivia Shertzer dribbles the ball during a game at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/DSC09782.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:37:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59523</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Set to Play American in Nation's Capital</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/11/mens-soccer-mountaineers-set-to-play-american-in-nations-capital</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/11/mens-soccer-mountaineers-set-to-play-american-in-nations-capital</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Julen Recalde dribbles the ball for WVU Men's Soccer" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/11/MSOC_vsUSC_Oct3_2026_AM_77_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 15 West Virginia University men's soccer team wraps up a two-game road trip at American on Monday for its final nonconference contest of the season. Kickoff from Reeves Field in the nation's capital is set for 1 p.m.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/MSOC_vsUSC_Oct3_2026_AM_77_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/MSOC_vsUSC_Oct3_2026_AM_77_large.jpg"><media:title>Julen Recalde dribbles the ball for WVU Men's Soccer</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/MSOC_vsUSC_Oct3_2026_AM_77_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:42:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59522</s:story_id></item><item><title>Golf Heads to Big 12 Match Play Championship</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/11/golf-heads-to-big-12-match-play-championship</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/11/golf-heads-to-big-12-match-play-championship</guid><category>Golf</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="A graphic of the Big 12 Match Play Tournament" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/11/GOLF26_Matchup_Big12MatchPlay_1920x1080_.png" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University golf team returns to action Monday through Wednesday at the Big 12 Match Play Championship. The event will take place at The Country Club in Salt Lake City, Utah.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/GOLF26_Matchup_Big12MatchPlay_1920x1080_.png" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/GOLF26_Matchup_Big12MatchPlay_1920x1080_.png"><media:title>A graphic of the Big 12 Match Play Tournament</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/11/GOLF26_Matchup_Big12MatchPlay_1920x1080_.png" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 07:50:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>5</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59521</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Finish Utah Trip with 3-0 Loss to No. 17 BYU</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/10/volleyball-mountaineers-finish-utah-trip-with-3-0-loss-to-no-17-byu</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/10/volleyball-mountaineers-finish-utah-trip-with-3-0-loss-to-no-17-byu</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU voleyball played at BYU on Oct. 10" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DAK09471__1_.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - The West Virginia University volleyball team (9-7, 2-4 Big 12) suffered a sweep to No. 17 BYU on Saturday night at George Albert Smith Fieldhouse in Provo, Utah. The Cougars won by set scores of 25-14, 25-19 and 25-12.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DAK09471__1_.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DAK09471__1_.jpg"><media:title>WVU voleyball played at BYU on Oct. 10</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DAK09471__1_.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:22:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59520</s:story_id></item><item><title>Arizona’s Big Plays Doom