/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DSC09947__1_.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University cross country team completed a sweep of its split-squad weekend on Saturday, claiming first place at the Carnegie Mellon Invitational with 45 points.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DSC09947__1_.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DSC09947__1_.jpg"><media:title>Tecla Lokrale runs during the John McNichols Invitational</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/10/DSC09947__1_.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:12:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>10</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59518</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Welcome Utah for Senior Day</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/10/womens-soccer-mountaineers-welcome-utah-for-senior-day</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/10/womens-soccer-mountaineers-welcome-utah-for-senior-day</guid><category>Women's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WSOC26_Utah Matchup_1920x1080" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/10/WSOC26_MATCHUP_UCONN_1920x1080.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 16-ranked West Virginia University women's soccer team continues its three-game homestand when it welcomes Utah to Morgantown for the first time on Sunday, Oct. 11. Kickoff at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium is set for 12 p.m. ET.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/10/WSOC26_MATCHUP_UCONN_1920x1080